  "productSlug": "eightx8",
  "shortDescription": "8x8 is a global unified-communications and contact-centre vendor: 8x8 Work (X Series) covers cloud phone, video meetings, team messaging and analytics, with Contact Center (X6\u2013X8) as a separate ladder. First-party pricing pages are often bot/quote gated; research floors cross-checked 2026-08-17 put Work X2 around $24 and X4 around $44 per user/month annual, with Express ~$15 and Contact Center ~$85\u2013$140 commonly cited. Mandatory regulatory/service fees are frequently reported on top of list seats. Scored as a RingCentral-class global UCaaS peer, not as a thin SMB virtual number.",
